script: BigInt.asUintN(4294967297, (-9223372036854775808n)) > 0n
note: a value of 4294967297 bits: out holds the specification's answer; the specification's value cannot be represented by any engine; each plan answers a RangeError at its representation's limit (JSD-0067 decision 2, Broiler.JS SharedLibraries.md SJL-4.5)
